    "name":  "12W LED Ceiling  Light  -PURELIGHT- Indoor Outdoor - IP65",
    "reference":  "LBH12W-NW-91243",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003ePowerful brightness, durability and energy efficiency are combined in this elegant \u003cstrong\u003e12W\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ewhite\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cstrong\u003ewall\u003c/strong\u003e or \u003cstrong\u003eceiling\u003c/strong\u003e light. It can be used both \u003cstrong\u003eindoors\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eoutdoors\u003c/strong\u003e. Weather resistant (\u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e), it is perfect for wet and high salinity areas, perfect for use in kitchens, bathrooms, storage rooms, gardens, terraces and more. Improve your spaces now! Buy it now and start saving! \u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e12W LED Ceiling Light - PURELIGHT - Indoor Outdoor - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLight Up Your Life with PURELIGHT - The Ultimate Choice for Any Space!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn the world of lighting, one product stands out for its exceptionality and versatility, and that product is our\u003cstrong\u003e PURELIGHT 12W LED Ceiling Light\u003c/strong\u003e. Looking for a lighting solution that will elevate your space to new heights? You\u0027ve found it! Let us take you on a journey through the innovation, efficiency and impeccable design that only PURELIGHT can offer.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOutstanding Benefits:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDazzling Brightness: With its powerful \u003cstrong\u003e12W\u003c/strong\u003e light output, the PURELIGHT LED ceiling light will illuminate your indoor and outdoor spaces with a luminosity that will transform any area into an oasis of light. Say goodbye to annoying shadows and bring life to every corner.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTough and Durable: Made of high quality Polycarbonate (PC), this LED ceiling light is resistant to the elements and durable. Its \u003cstrong\u003eIP65\u003c/strong\u003e rating ensures that it can withstand rain, snow or any weather conditions without losing its splendor.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnergy Efficient: PURELIGHT\u0027s advanced \u003cstrong\u003eLED technology\u003c/strong\u003e consumes very little energy, helping you save on your electricity bills while helping the environment.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy Installation: Equipped with an easy mounting design, this ceiling light fits perfectly anywhere you want to illuminate. Whether in your home, garden, patio, driveway, garage or commercial space, installation is a breeze.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElegant Style: PURELIGHT\u0027s sleek, modern design fits any decor. Add a touch of sophistication to your spaces effortlessly.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eUses of 12W LED Ceiling Light -PURELIGHT- Indoor Outdoor - IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndoor: Give a contemporary touch to your living room, bedroom, kitchen or bathroom. With PURELIGHT, every corner of your home shines with elegance and comfort.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutdoor: Transform your garden, patio, deck or driveway into an oasis of light. PURELIGHT\u0027s weather resistance makes it ideal for illuminating your outdoor spaces, creating a cozy and safe environment.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ePURELIGHT 12W LED ceiling light\u003c/strong\u003e is the answer to all your lighting needs. Don\u0027t settle for less, experience the PURELIGHT difference and elevate the quality of your spaces. The light that illuminates your dreams is just a click away, act now and bring the excellence of PURELIGHT to your life!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn FactorLED we ensure that our products have QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
